{"__lastUpdated": "2026-09-26T02:08:52.243Z", "__OculusDBType": "Application", "group": 0, "binaryType": 1, "hmd": 2, "__sn": "OculusDB-Official", "blocked": false, "appName": "Rusty Robots: The Harvest", "baseline_offer": {"status": "", "status_enum": -1, "end_time": 0, "id": "1553942069298922", "show_timer": false, "price": {"offset_amount": "0", "offset_amount_numerical": 0, "currency": "EUR", "formatted": "\u20ac0.00"}, "promo_benefit": null, "strikethrough_price": null, "__typename": "AppStoreOffer", "typename_enum": 8}, "priceFormatted": "\u20ac0.00", "priceOffsetNumerical": 0, "priceLimboDetected": false, "appHasDiscount": false, "discountEndTime": "0001-01-01T00:00:00", "appHasTrial": false, "appCanBeBought": true, "currency": "EUR", "canonicalName": "oliverfireroleplays-harvest-android6d0f-w8ws8y", "current_gift_offer": null, "current_offer": {"status": "", "status_enum": -1, "end_time": 0, "id": "1553942069298922", "show_timer": false, "price": {"offset_amount": "0", "offset_amount_numerical": 0, "currency": "EUR", "formatted": "\u20ac0.00"}, "promo_benefit": null, "strikethrough_price": null, "__typename": "AppStoreOffer", "typename_enum": 8}, "current_trial_offer": null, "displayName": "Rusty Robots: The Harvest", "display_name": "Rusty Robots: The Harvest", "display_long_description": "**Rusty Robots: The Harvest** (or simply **Harvest**) takes place in the distant future. Play with your friends across **MANY free-play maps**, with optional **20-player lobbies** for even more players!\n\nExplore maps such as:\n\n* The Bedroom\n* The Robo Gallery\n* The Maze\n* The Arcade\n* The Forest\n* The Robo Shop\n* OG\n* And more!\n\nThere are also several gamemodes and minigames to play, including:\n\n* **Bomb Tag:** A competitive hot-potato style tag game taking place in the Forest. Pass the bomb to other players before it's too late!\n* **Snowball PVP:** Battle the opposing teams using snowball cannons! Fight across three bases, Red, Green, and Blue, with a central island in the middle.\n* **Slender Horror:** Play the Slender-themed minigame in the Arcade.\n* **Pacman:** Play the Pacman minigame in the Arcade.\n* **Fireball Survival:** Dodge fireballs and try to survive as long as possible.\n\nFree-play takes place inside a simulation run by **Robo-Labs**, a sort of playground for testing the 4 Robo-Labs Robo Models, including the **All-New Robo V4!**\n\nCustomize your \"Unit\" with a **surplus of cosmetics** available in the Robo Shop, including hats, masks, skins, holdables, and more. Players start with **800 currency** and receive **150 currency every day they log in**.\n\nHarvest uses a **semi-realistic graphics style** to bring the Robo-Labs simulation to life.\n\n**UGC is planned through mod.io**, with plans to let players create and share their own **maps** in the future.\n\nTrailer by **@JacobTheYeepsDude** on YouTube.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "**Rusty Robots: The Harvest** (or simply **Harvest**) takes place in the distant future. Play with your friends across **MANY free-play maps**, with optional **20-player lobbies** for even more players!\n\nExplore maps such as:\n\n* The Bedroom\n* The Robo Gallery\n* The Maze\n* The Arcade\n* The Forest\n* The Robo Shop\n* OG\n* And more!\n\nThere are also several gamemodes and minigames to play, including:\n\n* **Bomb Tag:** A competitive hot-potato style tag game taking place in the Forest. Pass the bomb to other players before it's too late!\n* **Snowball PVP:** Battle the opposing teams using snowball cannons! Fight across three bases, Red, Green, and Blue, with a central island in the middle.\n* **Slender Horror:** Play the Slender-themed minigame in the Arcade.\n* **Pacman:** Play the Pacman minigame in the Arcade.\n* **Fireball Survival:** Dodge fireballs and try to survive as long as possible.\n\nFree-play takes place inside a simulation run by **Robo-Labs**, a sort of playground for testing the 4 Robo-Labs Robo Models, including the **All-New Robo 